  <jpcrp030000-asr_E01493-000:NotesRegardingGainOnBargainPurchaseTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 2px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24px"&gt;※５　負ののれん発生益&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 2px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 12px"&gt;前連結会計年度（自2022年４月１日　至2023年３月31日）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 2px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: 24px"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 36px; line-height: 18px; margin-right: 2px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -24px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
